Thinking: A fixed 8K default understated long-context models, while passing -c 0 would disable llama.cpp's reduction path. Eval-v2 represents automatic selection as None and therefore emits no -c; llama.cpp starts at trained context, fits to its 1 GiB memory margin, and /props supplies the signed effective number. The reproduce command pins that number. Auto mode rejects fit-off, visual prompts contain no hidden system message, no reasoning flag is injected, and generation ceilings rise enough for complete SVG/HTML. Tests prove omitted versus fixed -c behavior and exact prompt messages. Refs ADR-005, ADR-008, ADR-014, ADR-015, ADR-016.
